    "long_instructions": "Use **PAIR Programming with AI** to help manage your postings:\r\n\r\n* **Prompt:** Ask AI to generate or explain a helper.\r\n\r\n* **Analyze:** Compare two possible versions or lines of code.\r\n\r\n* **Integrate:** Implement and test in the display.\r\n\r\n* **Reflect:** Write a short statement about how helper functions protect data consistency in *reflection.md*\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### 🥐 Flash Sale!\r\n**Status:** Urgent Update\r\n\r\n**Details:** You baked way too many croissants this morning. You need to announce a \"50% Off Sale\" right **now** to clear the shelves.\r\n\r\n**Action Required:** Add this announcement to the very **start** of your feed so it's the first thing people see (Monday slot).\r\n\r\n* **Title:** \"50% Off Croissants\"\r\n* **Content:** \"Grab them while they're hot!\"\r\n* **Image:** \"croissant.jpg\"",
